## Clues
A1. A city in Persia. ~ KOM
A1 ^Printed: 1-2
A3. A city in Brazil. ~ BAHIA
A3 ^Printed: 3-7
A7. A city in Persia. ~ YEZD
A7 ^Printed: 9-10
A8. A city in Spain. ~ REUS
A8 ^Printed: 15-16
A11. A waterfall in Idaho. ~ TWIN
A11 ^Printed: 11-12
A12. A city in Hungary. ~ GYOR
A12 ^Printed: 17-18
A13. A city in Asiatic Russia. ~ TOMSK
A13 ^Printed: 20-24
A16. A city on the Danube river. ~ ULM
A16 ^Printed: 25-26

D1. A sea—Russian empire. ~ KARA
D1 ^Printed: 1-4
D2. An island—Hawaiian. ~ MAUI
D2 ^Printed: 2-6
D4. A city in Germany. ~ HAARLEM
D4 ^Printed: 5-22
D4 ^Note: Haarlem is in the Netherlands, not Germany; the clue or the answer is wrong in the original
D5. A city in Turkey. ~ ADANA
D5 ^Printed: 8-13
D6. A city in Portugal. ~ BRAGA
D6 ^Printed: 14-19
D7. A city in northern Africa. ~ YAT
D7 ^Printed: 9-11
D7 ^Note: no city YAT is known; every letter is clear in the key, shared with YEZD and TWIN
D9. A mountain in India. ~ SER
D9 ^Printed: 16-18
D9 ^Note: no Indian mountain SER is known; every letter is clear in the key, shared with REUS and GYOR
D14. A city in Japan. ~ OTSU
D14 ^Printed: 21-25
D15. An Asiatic monarchy. ~ SIAM
D15 ^Printed: 23-26


